                        "sense_id": "34b8326b-c84f-38f3-8e0d-b17762dbcbd4",
                        "entry_id": "3be0373e-7584-3e98-bfd0-1060d8e244f7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person with an excessive interest in his/her own opinions."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f421134d-f492-47f2-9503-d97c165986ef",
                                "sense_id": "34b8326b-c84f-38f3-8e0d-b17762dbcbd4",
                                "text": "And no people are lesse Philosophers and more foolish, than Platoes Philodoxes, or lovers of their owne opinions."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "65040e2c-7270-401f-a1e3-65bb0f38fbc4",
                                "sense_id": "34b8326b-c84f-38f3-8e0d-b17762dbcbd4",
                                "text": "This, however, is a difficult task that only a true philosopher, and not a mere philodox, will be willing to tackle."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f2751dbf-5e4f-4fad-a16c-2b121e11d40a",
                                "sense_id": "34b8326b-c84f-38f3-8e0d-b17762dbcbd4",
                                "text": "Consider that without realizing it you may have engaged in acokoinonia (sex without passion or desire), been bored to tears by the company of a philodox (someone in love with their opinions), or suffered from recurrent matutolypea (getting up on the wrong side of the bed)."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
